WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.848
The Essay paper carries 250

2
00:00:02.848 --> 00:00:04.894
marks. And it's the paper

3
00:00:04.894 --> 00:00:07.135
most people practise least.

4
00:00:07.465 --> 00:00:08.785
You write 2 essays,

5
00:00:08.785 --> 00:00:10.106
one from each of two

6
00:00:10.106 --> 00:00:12.387
sections. For 250 marks,

7
00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:14.236
in three hours.

8
00:00:14.576 --> 00:00:15.821
Open with a story,

9
00:00:15.821 --> 00:00:16.401
a fact,

10
00:00:16.401 --> 00:00:17.419
or a question.

11
00:00:17.419 --> 00:00:19.607
Then cover many angles.

12
00:00:19.607 --> 00:00:21.171
And close on a balanced,

13
00:00:21.171 --> 00:00:22.881
forward-looking note.

14
00:00:23.204 --> 00:00:24.614
Spend the first twenty to

15
00:00:24.614 --> 00:00:26.711
thirty minutes planning each one.

16
00:00:26.711 --> 00:00:28.841
A planned essay rarely loses

17
00:00:28.841 --> 00:00:30.026
its way.

18
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:31.971
Your turn.

19
00:00:31.971 --> 00:00:33.866
How many essays?
